  "story": {
    "day": 62,
    "title": "A Special Weekend Outing",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya usually walked by the national park before her morning breakfast.",
      "Today, she saw a cute baby animal inside the green area.",
      "A Spanish singer in a bright T-shirt took a photo of them.",
      "He was very friendly to some people.",
      "\"Oh, he's my baseball hero!\" a teammate talked to us.",
      "Next, they needed a pen to finish an interview with the boss.",
      "The boss gave them his notebook.",
      "After that, they walked slowly to a Chinese restaurant for dinner.",
      "The staff served a healthy recipe with a seaweed roll.",
      "These cold drinks from the U.S. had a design of an elephant.",
      "Finally, they liked the color of their P.E. ball in the evening."
    ]
  }
